01:09:03,333 --> 01:09:09,333
Save the Last Dance is a 2001 American dance film produced by MTV Films,
directed by Thomas Carter and distributed by Paramount Pictures.

12
01:15:20,000 --> 01:15:26,000
The film stars Julia Stiles and Sean Patrick Thomas as a teenage interracial couple in Chicago who
work together to help Stiles's character train for a Juilliard School dance audition.

13
01:21:36,666 --> 01:21:42,666
Released theatrically in the United States on January 12, 2001,
the film received mixed reviews from critics.

14
01:27:53,333 --> 01:27:59,333
It was a box-office success and grossed $131.5 million
worldwide against a $13 million budget.

